Package: tilo
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, cinnamon (>= 6.0)
Provides: cinnamon-tilo
Description: Windows 11 style snap layouts for the Cinnamon desktop
 tilo adds a layout picker to Cinnamon. Drag a window toward the top of the
 screen and a bar of layouts drops down; drop the window on a zone to place it.
 The same picker opens from a shortcut, and zones can be drawn by hand.
 .
 Dragging the border between two tiled windows resizes both, and an arrangement
 of windows can be saved and restored onto whatever is already open.
 .
 It is a Cinnamon extension rather than a separate program, so it adds no
 daemon, no runtime and nothing to the session startup. It never modifies a
 setting that belongs to the desktop without explicit consent, and restores
 anything it is allowed to override.
 .
 The package installs the extension but does not enable it. Enable it from
 Settings, Extensions.
